<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</title>
<headline>Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are secondary market rates quoted by banks on Friday for Philippine government securities. The rates are indicative as maturities are slightly varying.</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>  BANK		     RATES BID/OFFER PCT</p>
<p>			    3-mths	   6-mths	  1-year</p>
<p>Bank of America	10.75 /10.65    11.10 /11.00   11.60 /11.50</p>
<p>BPI			10.70 /10.665   11.125/11.02   11.55/11.515</p>
<p>Hong Kong Bank	 10.70 /10.60    11.10 /11.00   11.575/11.475</p>
<p>Multinational	  10.665/10.55    11.10 /10.90   11.60 /11.50</p>
<p>PCIBank		  10.70 /10.65    11.08 /11.015  11.55 /11.50</p>
<p>PNB			10.70 /10.60    11.10 /11.00   11.525/11.40</p>
<p>Security Bank	  10.70 /10.65    11.10 /11.05   11.60 /11.50</p>
<p>Solidbank		10.70 /10.66    11.05 /11.00   11.60 /11.50</p>
<p>Standard Chartered   10.70 /10.65    11.05 /10.95   11.60 /11.50</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
